OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of poppies made by
OL,4,Aincognito couple
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 1,500 poppies have been
OL,7,Fhandmade to commemorate Remembrance day
OL,8,Fby an island couple who wish to remain
OL,9,Fanonymous.
OL,11,FA pair spent hours creating the
OL,12,Findividual poppies and spent five hours
OL,13,Finstalling them outside the Parish Hall
OL,14,Fin St John.
OL,16,FThe church service in St John will
OL,17,Fstart at 10:15GMT on Remembrance Sunday
OL,18,Fand at 11:00GMT the names of the people
OL,19,Fon the Cenotaph will be read out.
