OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of poppies made by
OL,4,Aincognito couple
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstable of St John, Andy Jehan said:
OL,7,F"I think you can say the finished
OL,8,Fproduct is excellent. So we're really
OL,9,Fthrilled."
